        "identified_by": "citation",
        "study_numbers": "",
        "replication_study_numbers": "",
        "evidence_quote": "To confirm the role of social factors in mediating cognitive processes, this systematic replication study seeks to extend the generalizability of an exploratory study (McDonough, Crowther, Kielstra & Trofimovich 2015) that reported a positive association between eye gaze and second language (L2) speakers’ responses to recasts.",
